Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,//------------------EDCN-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.24,0:27:33.09,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}唯有无情的话语  杂乱地遍布于小镇之中
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.47,0:27:42.54,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}{\fn@DFPHSMincho-W5\fs15\fsp1}NEVER MORE{\r\blur3}  悲伤的声音流淌而过
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.69,0:27:52.87,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}平淡的日常生活宣告了离别
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.97,0:28:02.57,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}我们失去了那无可取代的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.11,0:28:13.30,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}蒙蒙细雨挡住太阳  夺走光明
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.24,0:28:27.07,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}失去坚信之物的我无比烦恼  但
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.61,0:28:39.26,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}我不会忘记  与大家度过的珍重的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.86,0:28:49.44,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}{\fn@DFPHSMincho-W5\fs15\fsp1}NEVER MORE{\r\blur3}  黑暗之中我也不再孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.04,0:28:59.05,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}努力找回吧  找回那丢失的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.53,0:29:11.90,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}{\fn@DFPHSMincho-W5\fs15\fsp1}NEVER MORE{\r\blur3}  你的声音一定能  指引我前行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.03,0:29:22.68,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}我不会忘记  与大家度过的珍重的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.26,0:29:32.83,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}{\fn@DFPHSMincho-W5\fs15\fsp1}NEVER MORE{\r\blur3}  黑暗之中我也不再孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.41,0:29:42.38,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}努力找回吧  找回那丢失的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.92,0:29:55.27,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}{\fn@DFPHSMincho-W5\fs15\fsp1}NEVER MORE{\r\blur3}  你的声音一定能  指引我前行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.27,0:30:01.01,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}至今依然记忆犹新
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.38,0:30:12.31,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\q2}感触到你的那个夜晚
